<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', padding: '0 64px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8F0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>FACTR 2 · 论文解析与 PiPER 复现</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>07 / 19</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '96px 64px 32px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', height: 720 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>FIRST：把「接触前」多喂几遍</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>用力矩把示教切成三段，再按权重重新采样。改的是数据分布，不是损失函数。</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 30, marginTop: 24, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>逐帧算接触分数</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>f_t = ‖τ_ext,t‖₁，六关节外力矩取绝对值再求和，一个标量。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>双阈值滞回判接触</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>高阈值进入、低阈值退出，避免在阈值附近反复翻转。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>打三相标签</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>自由运动 / 接触前（接触起点前 1 秒）/ 接触。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>按权重重新采样</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>w_F : w_PC : w_C = 1 : 5 : 1；持续接触任务改 1 : 3 : 3。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Image src="assets/fig10_segmentation.jpg" style={{ width: 470, height: 252, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>论文图 10：用 τ_ext 切出的三相标签，横轴为时间，三段颜色对应自由运动、接触前与接触。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 22px', marginTop: 14 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>策略只多一路输入（τ_ext），训练循环里只改采样器。这也是它容易复现的原因。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingTop: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>来源：论文第 5 节、图 10、附录 D.3 表 8</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>FACTR 2 · 2026.10</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
